{"id":"n29687-1-17","stage":0,"title":"그림 · 画儿","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29687-1-17-1","ko":"어떤 그림을 좋아하세요?","zh":"您喜欢哪类画呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그림을","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하세요?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/791bd4ae35eaf0b98cef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29687-1-17-2","ko":"저는 인물을 그린 그림이 좋아요.","zh":"我喜欢画人物肖像的画。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인물을","meaning":"人物","explanation":"인물：人物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인물","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25066","senseId":"1","lemma":"인물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그린","meaning":"画","explanation":"그리다：画；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그림이","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"16673e931e1465c5","term":"인물","zh":"人物","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3","entryId":"25066","definition":"人本身。","pronunciation":["인물"]},{"id":"729cbc127a38cc4c","term":"그리다","zh":"画","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3","entryId":"57277","definition":"利用铅笔或毛笔等以线条或色彩来表现事物。","pronunciation":["그ː리다"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3de7bae6f67b18e3cff7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.657,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29687","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","source